@startuml timp
title Diagramă de timp: taskurile device-ului (~10 s)

scale 1000 as 80 pixels

concise "Periodic (T = 2000 ms)" as P
concise "Sporadic (MIN = 5000 ms)" as S
concise "Aperiodic" as A

@0
P is "J1"
S is {hidden}
A is {hidden}

@100
P is {hidden}

@2000
P is "J2"

@2100
P is {hidden}

@4000
P is "J3 (T > prag)"

@4100
P is {hidden}
S is "publică alarma"

@4200
S is {hidden}

@6000
P is "J4 (T > prag)"

@6100
P is {hidden}
S is "RESPINS (2000 < 5000)"

@6250
S is {hidden}

@7000
A is "SET_THRESHOLD"

@7150
A is {hidden}

@8000
P is "J5"

@8100
P is {hidden}

@10000
P is "J6"

@10100
P is {hidden}

P@4000 -> S@4100 : eveniment
P@6000 -> S@6100 : eveniment

highlight 6100 to 6250 #Gold : alarmă respinsă
@enduml